23.7,1954,45,114,23]],"links":[["Ellis County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/oklahoma/ellis-county"],["ARC or PLC in Ellis County","/arc-plc/oklahoma/ellis-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids. November to December came in under 90% of normal in 43 of those years. On the middle of the grids, 2026 so far ran 23% of normal in March to April and 34% in April to May. Grid 19320 had its driest year in 1956 at 49%.</p>"}
